# Screens
# Minimal, stress-friendly emergency UI screens:
# - home_screen.dart: Main hub (Nearby people, SOS trigger, Messages, Family, Broadcast, Battery status)
# - sos_screen.dart: One-Tap SOS dispatch with GPS coordinates
# - messages_screen.dart: P2P chat through multi-hop mesh
# - family_screen.dart: Phone-based family lookup, reachability status, hop display & "Save to Family"
# - broadcast_screen.dart: Local emergency hazard announcements
